# The build context is the whole repository (apps/api/Dockerfile needs the lockfile and the workspace files);
# keep out everything the image does not need, and anything that must never be baked into an image.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
.git
.github
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
apps/web
carPhotos
docs
*.md
